  "headline": "MPR Verifies Cawapres Files And Consults Experts On Election",
  "seoTitle": "MPR Verifies Cawapres Files and Consults Experts",
  "metaDescription": "The MPR verification team confirms candidate credentials at the Supreme Court while consulting constitutional experts on the vice president election process.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "The MPR verification team examined legal records for vice presidential candidates Andi Amran Sulaiman and Sugiono at the Supreme Court.",
    "Parliamentary officials are consulting three constitutional law experts regarding the mechanism for filling the vacant vice presidential office.",
    "The MPR has mobilized 36 members organized into three working groups to oversee the formal verification process for the candidates."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Majelis Permusyawaratan Rakyat (MPR) is actively proceeding with the formal verification of candidates nominated for the position of vice president for the remainder of the 2024-2029 term. Following the submission of names by President Prabowo, the MPR has activated a 36-member verification team divided into specialized working groups. This team has visited the Mahkamah Agung (MA) to confirm the legal and citizenship status of candidates Andi Amran Sulaiman and Sugiono. Simultaneously, the MPR's Ad Hoc Committee has initiated consultations with constitutional experts, including Jimly Asshiddiqie, Maria Farida, and Hamdan Zoelva, to ensure that the election mechanism adheres to established legal principles of objectivity and professionalism. Discussions regarding the procedural rules for the potential upcoming plenary session continue as the body manages the legal requirements for replacing the previous vice president.",
